replace('REQ-operations-wallet-2','statement','immutable Xmax of 500000 USDG expressed as {chainId: 4663, assetId: USDG, decimals: 6, amountAtomic: 500000000000}','the explicit immutable constructor-configured processClaimLimitMaxWei, whose proposed value is derived conservatively from the existing 500000 USD economic ceiling and an owner-approved launch valuation','A dollar-valued ceiling cannot be copied as an ETH atomic integer.')
replace('REQ-operations-wallet-2','statement','No limit change resets history or usage.','The initial processClaimLimit6hWei and processClaimLimitMaxWei are positive explicit wei values in the approved launch configuration; no USDG atomic integer or guessed ETH default is reused. The contract enforces these ETH ceilings without an onchain oracle; live USD spending controls remain the bot policy engine responsibility. No limit change resets history or usage.','Separate immutable ETH enforcement from live USD policy.')
