replace('REQ-cycle-repository-1','statement','A position stores its configured USDG control value as a verified insured amount only when that amount is already the configured USDG asset; otherwise it stores the attributed purchase cost. It never converts a Solana stablecoin insured value without a frozen quote binding.','A position stores its attributed purchase cost in USD micro-units. A typed insured amount can replace that control value only with a valid exact-amount quote-derived USD valuation bound to its asset, request, digest and validity window; a Solana stablecoin amount is never assumed equal to USD. Historical committed purchase costs are not revalued when ETH moves.','Keep held cost attribution and exclude unverified USD/USDC parity.')
