replace('REQ-cycle-runner-3','statement','Only finalized, cycle-attributed return deltas may become an Operations USDG credit or payout basis.','Native principal and gas share the ETH asset identity but occupy separate reservation and cost buckets; spendable principal excludes the gas reserve and unpaid obligations. Only finalized cycle-attributed native payment proofs may become an Operations ETH credit or payout basis. A direct native payment is proved from the persisted signed transaction identity, exact sender, recipient, value and calldata, successful receipt and canonical finalized block; a trusted hook post-payment event proves a claim. Internal Relay return or refund proof additionally authenticates emitter runtime, request linkage, decoded recipient/value and failure propagation. Missing proof leaves proceeds unavailable. No wallet-wide delta or fabricated ERC20 Transfer event proves a native credit. Historical USDG journals remain readable but cannot resume through the native runtime or be rescaled; native cycles use fresh identities.','Native internal payment proof, separate gas/principal and historical-state refusal are required.')
