replace('REQ-cycle-runner-3','statement','Any non-native-EVM row stays on hookemon.custody-ledger.v1, or, if migrated to v2, stays permanently unvalued','Any non-native-EVM row stays on hookemon.custody-ledger.v1, or, if migrated to v2, stays permanently unvalued','Do not create a new Solana evidence producer through the ETH migration.')
replace('REQ-cycle-runner-3','measurement','a non-native-EVM row constructed as v2 remains permanently unvalued absent an approved producer.','a non-native-EVM row constructed as v2 remains permanently unvalued absent an approved producer. Native tests reject wrong request/emitter/runtime/value, failed internal calls, unrelated deposits, stale or reorged receipts, duplicate proofs, old USDG resume and any principal spending that consumes the gas reserve.','Add exact native proof negative cases.')
