replace('REQ-direct-payout-1','statement','It marks paid only after an exact finalized delta. Frozen recipients become quarantine liabilities','It marks paid only after proof of the exact successful finalized transaction matched to persisted signed bytes/hash, source, recipient, value and calldata; a recipient may forward ETH and its ending balance is not payment proof. Rejected recipient calls become quarantine liabilities','Native transaction proof replaces token balance deltas and preserves unpaid entitlements.')
replace('REQ-direct-payout-1','statement','Frozen recipients','Rejected recipients','Native rejection replaces USDG freeze.') if 'Frozen recipients' in rows['REQ-direct-payout-1']['statement'] else None
replace('REQ-direct-payout-1','statement','frozen recipient','rejecting recipient','Preserve quarantine on native rejection.')
