replace('REQ-policy-engine-1','statement','{chainId: 4663, assetId: USDG, decimals: 6, amountAtomic: 0}','{chainId: "4663", assetId: "native", decimals: 18, amountAtomic: "0"}','The explicit zero minimum remains zero in native ETH units.')
replace('REQ-policy-engine-1','statement','It evaluates finalized observed balances and obligations separately, with unresolved principal counted once.','It evaluates finalized observed balances and obligations separately, with unresolved principal counted once. The existing USD outer rails remain 55 per unit, 165 per cycle and 495 per rolling day, with tighter owner limits preserved. Existing unit and aggregate Relay quote admission binds each USD valuation to the exact fetched request, quote digest, chain, asset, atomic amount and validity window, using integer decimal arithmetic with costs/exposure rounded up and proceeds rounded down. Committed spend remains at validated USD cost basis; unresolved liquid ETH or USDC exposure requires fresh bound valuation before additional risk and cannot double-count existing reservations. The policy separately checks exact ETH transaction maxima and the gas reserve. Missing valuation refuses new risk but not reconciliation or separately authorized recovery. The 250 USD test envelope limits external owner capital counted once, not recycled turnover or every production cycle. No second budget helper or onchain oracle is introduced.','Preserve economic caps and extend the existing engine with exact quote-based USD accounting.')
